# The runtime subcharts are packaged from their sources under
# installer/charts/educates-training-platform/charts by
# `make package-local-charts`, which every operator build runs first. They
# are build output rather than vendored charts, so they are not committed.
# The upstream charts beside them are vendored and stay committed.
secrets-manager-*.tgz
lookup-service-*.tgz
session-manager-*.tgz
node-ca-injector-*.tgz
remote-access-*.tgz
